---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HeroSection from "../components/Sections/HeroSection.astro";
import EventList from "../components/Sections/EventList.astro";
import SermonList from "../components/Sections/SermonList.astro";
import Button from "../components/UI/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <HeroSection 
    title="与光同行"
    subtitle="一起经历与主耶稣同行的全人更新"
    backgroundImage="/uploads/light6.jpg"
    ctaText="心理辅导"
    ctaLink="/counselling"
    secondaryCtaText="全人更新"
    secondaryCtaLink="/renewal"
  />
  
---
// 保持顶部的 Frontmatter 不变
---

<section class="py-16 bg-stone-50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">近期活动</h2>
        <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-primary-600 mx-auto mt-2"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-primary-400">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-2">筹备中</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">正在筹备</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li>• 填写活动名称...</li>
            <li class="text-sm text-gray-400">计划于近期推出</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-green-500">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-2">进行中</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">正在进行</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li class="font-medium text-primary-700">▶ 填写进行中的活动...</li>
            <li class="text-sm">每周固定时间 / 在线平台</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">我们的异象</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-8 leading-relaxed text-center">我们渴望被天父塑造成为一个<strong>福音为本、圣灵更新、以神为乐、全人跟随主耶稣</strong>的共同体：</p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary-500 bg-stone-50">
          <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">1. 福音为本</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">我们与上帝健康的关系唯独建立在耶稣基督的福音上，成长的动力和方向都来自福音，而不是来自惧怕、比较或自我要求。祂为我死，我为祂活。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary-500 bg-stone-50">
          <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">2. 圣灵更新</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">我们生命的改变不是一味靠自己努力达成的，而是圣灵大能的更新。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary-500 bg-stone-50">
          <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">3. 以神为乐</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">圣经所启示的三一真神是我们最大的福乐。</p>
          <p class="text-xs italic text-gray-500">“除你以外，在天上我有谁呢？除你以外，在地上我也没有所爱慕的。”（诗 73:25）</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary-500 bg-stone-50">
          <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">4. 全人跟随</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">基于福音的缘故，我们愿意在生活的每个层面回应上帝的爱，跟随主耶稣。</p>
          <p class="text-xs italic text-gray-500">“所以，你们或吃或喝，无论做什么，都要为荣耀神而行。”（林前 10:31）</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-stone-50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">个人成长</h2>
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm mb-8">
        <p class="mb-6 text-gray-700">我们认为个人成长的核心在于跟上帝拥有健康的关系，这健康的关系由以下四个要素决定：</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6 text-center">
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary-50 rounded-lg font-bold text-primary-800 text-sm">纯正的福音<br><span class="text-xs font-normal">(加1:6-9)</span></div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary-50 rounded-lg font-bold text-primary-800 text-sm">纯粹的信心<br><span class="text-xs font-normal">(罗5:1)</span></div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary-50 rounded-lg font-bold text-primary-800 text-sm">上帝的道<br><span class="text-xs font-normal">(提后3:16-17)</span></div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary-50 rounded-lg font-bold text-primary-800 text-sm">圣灵的大能<br><span class="text-xs font-normal">(徒1:8)</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">在此基础上，上帝通过我们的个人探索与群体互动，带领我们每日更新。没有了以上要素，信仰会落入形式主义、功利主义、成功神学等陷阱。</p>
        <p class="text-sm italic text-gray-500 border-t pt-4">我们承认成长并非直线上升，也会有软弱、迷茫和停滞，但上帝从未离开，仍在耐心地塑造我们。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="text-orange-900 font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="mr-2">⚠</span> 我们刻意避免的方向
        </h4>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-orange-800">
          <li>✕ 把信仰简化为成功、得胜和正面情绪</li>
          <li>✕ 把属灵成长等同于事工表现</li>
          <li>✕ 用属灵语言掩盖真实生命的问题</li>
          <li>✕ 用对错代替陪伴与聆听</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">同工服侍</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 text-lg font-medium">服侍的核心在于日常与上帝的活泼关系</p>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-1/12 text-3xl font-serif text-primary-200">01</div>
          <div class="md:w-11/12">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">恩典与特权</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">是上帝邀请我们与祂同工的机会。我们带着感恩与敬畏，而非勉强或交换的心态。</p>
            <div class="bg-stone-50 p-4 rounded text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
              “我们原是他的工作...为要叫我们行善。”（弗 2:10）
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-1/12 text-3xl font-serif text-primary-200">02</div>
          <div class="md:w-11/12">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">回应爱，而非赚取爱</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">不是为了赚取祂的爱，也不是为了成就感。主成就的救恩极大，我们仅是微小却真实的回应。</p>
            <div class="bg-stone-50 p-4 rounded text-sm text-gray-500 italic">“我们爱，因为神先爱我们。”（约一 4:19）</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-primary-900 text-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl mt-12">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-primary-100">在实际服侍中：</h4>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <div class="border-l border-primary-700 pl-4">
              <p class="font-bold mb-2 text-primary-200">跟随神的节奏</p>
              <p>形式与期限不是固定的。开始或暂停并不代表属灵程度高低，而是顺服上帝当下的带领。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l border-primary-700 pl-4">
              <p class="font-bold mb-2 text-primary-200">陪伴而非操控</p>
              <p>目标不是完成属灵指标，而是在爱中陪伴人回应上帝。用生命服侍生命。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl bg-gray-50">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest">场景：面对反感上帝的朋友</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">提供力所能及的支持。若无机会分享福音，仍选择忠心去爱，焦点在于跟随神而非完成指标。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl bg-gray-50">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest">场景：面对软弱怀疑的信徒</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">以祷告与陪伴回应，不急于纠正或施加属灵压力，相信上帝会在合适的时候亲自坚固他。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
          
          <Button href="/about-us">
            Learn More About Us
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Events Section -->
  <EventList />
  
  <!-- Sermons Section -->
  <SermonList />
  
  <!-- Ministries Preview -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Our Ministries</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Discover how you can connect, serve, and grow through our various ministries
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="card text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-primary-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Children's Ministry</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Nurturing the spiritual growth of our children through engaging, age-appropriate activities.
          </p>
          <a href="/ministries/childrens-ministry" class="text-primary-600 font-medium hover:text-primary-700">
            Learn More →
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-secondary-100 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-secondary-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Worship Ministry</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Leading our congregation in worship through music, song, and creative expression.
          </p>
          <a href="/ministries/worship-ministry" class="text-primary-600 font-medium hover:text-primary-700">
            Learn More →
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-accent-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Community Outreach</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Serving our local community through various programs and initiatives to share God's love.
          </p>
          <a href="/ministries/community-outreach" class="text-primary-600 font-medium hover:text-primary-700">
            Learn More →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <Button href="/ministries" variant="outline">
          View All Ministries
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <section 
    class="py-20 bg-cover bg-center text-white"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)), url(/uploads/thank-you-bg.webp)"
  >
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">Ready to Join Our Community?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8">
          We'd love to welcome you to our church family. Come visit us this Sunday or reach out with any questions.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <Button href="/im-new" variant="primary" size="lg">
            I'm New Here
          </Button>
          
          <Button href="/contact" variant="outline" size="lg" class="bg-white/10 text-white border-white hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 backdrop-blur-sm">
            Contact Us
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
